  <h2 id="short-answer">The short answer to "is marketing a good career"</h2>

  <p>
    Marketing is a real, durable career field in India, not a fallback for people who "didn't get into finance."
    But the question hides a bigger one: which marketing? A brand manager at a consumer goods company, a product
    marketer at a SaaS startup, a market researcher reading survey data, and a trade marketing manager negotiating
    shelf space are all technically "in marketing," and they do almost nothing alike day to day.
  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Most "is marketing a good career" articles answer for digital marketing specifically — SEO, ads, social
      media — because that is where most of the entry-level noise and course marketing sits. That leaves the
      older, more traditional side of marketing badly under-explained: brand management, product marketing,
      market research, and trade or offline marketing. These four tracks are where a large share of genuinely
